{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_017AD0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，研发班的人开发出了这么个东西……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这是！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"纸箱坦克。和其他纸箱一样，两个人可以一起钻进去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"前面的人负责驾驶，后面的人当炮手，听说还能开炮……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"喂，Kaz。是谁开发出这东西的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"抱、抱歉，Boss。他也不是故意的。再怎么说，也不至于有人会把这东西错认成坦克……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"太棒了！！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"啊？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"隐蔽性与攻击力的完美融合。粗犷的设计也很不错。这才叫完美设计！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"喂，Kaz。带我去见做出这东西的人。我要亲自向他道谢。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"你、你认真的？Snake。这东西怎么看都……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"怎么看都是杰作。你看不出来吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"S、Snake！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"哇，好棒的坦克。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"Paz！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"虽然我讨厌坦克，但这个的话感觉能喜欢上。最棒的是不会排放废气。这样就不会污染哥斯达黎加的森林了，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":153,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"诶诶！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"Kaz，干得好。把副司令交给你果然是对的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"怎、怎么会……难道是我……是我不正常吗！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"}]}